WEBVTT

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:10.430
We, the British Army, will now march on 
the Twilight base, St. Paul's Cathedral.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:13.510
Right now, for this moment alone,

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:16.860
please act as the sword 
of Alexandrina Victoria!

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:32.000
Charge!

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:36.010
Soon...

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:39.810
Soon, we will become one.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:46.820
Will this make Father look at me?

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.250
Will he love me?

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:27.500
Promise

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:28.490
It's quiet.

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:32.760
Yeah. I guess the diversion force is 
doing a good job distracting them.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:36.290
That old man Leon is pretty damn good.

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:05.670
Well, I guess there's no way it'd 
be completely deserted, huh?

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:07.820
Yeah, of course this would happen.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:12.710
I'll handle things here!

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:13.460
Drac...

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:14.500
Don't be stupid!

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:15.920
You can't take them alone!

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:19.380
Don't you all have something 
you need to do?

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:23.630
Leave the weaklings to me and go!

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:25.390
We owe you.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.510
Guys, let's go!

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:28.880
Be careful.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:42.890
Those moves...

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:44.910
There's no question. He's a vampire!

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:47.910
Why is he siding with us?

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:50.120
I don't care what his reason is!

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:52.080
He took the initiative to fight for us!

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:54.620
Don't fall too far behind him!

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:07.090
Where's the entrance to 
the underground level?

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:09.550
Stop rushing me, would you?

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:11.210
I'm looking for it.

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:14.010
It's here.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:15.780
What is?

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:17.100
Hold out your hand.

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:20.400
There's a draft coming through...

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:22.540
This is the entrance?

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:24.770
Yeah, there's no doubt.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:28.360
There has to be a way to open it somewhere.

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:50.660
Bingo!

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:54.670
Twilight!

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:59.650
I can't let you go any farther.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:01.930
Aleister...

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:07.640
Hello, Van. Thanks for what 
you did at the Tower Bridge.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:09.150
You know him?

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:11.570
He's Twilight's number two.

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:14.160
So he's your former superior?

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:19.540
Why would a man like you dirty your 
hands with a revolt like this?

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:24.550
Let's just say I have my reasons.

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:40.600
Cardia! Are you okay?

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.600
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:49.230
Wow! That's my angel! I could fall in—

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.280
Move it!

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:53.110
Let's go!

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:54.690
Everyone, hurry!

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:03.500
Now, let's go.

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:05.840
Thank you!

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:17.210
Old battle habits die hard, you know.

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:24.520
Allow me to be your opponent.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:25.900
Count...

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:30.860
There is nothing harder than 
fighting with a former ally.

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:33.920
Don't worry about me. Go.

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:34.940
Thanks.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.550
I'd rather you stayed out of my way.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:42.410
Van, hurry up!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.920
Shut the door!

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:00.350
Take a nap!

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:18.540
My goodness. You're still coming after me?

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.080
It would have been safer 
to stay out of my way.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:22.630
Yes.

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:30.220
Please continue to humor me a bit longer.

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:34.100
So, that is your unique weapon?

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:35.600
Interesting.

00:07:56.510 --> 00:08:00.040
Rebels, surrender at once!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:03.580
Those who disobey will be cut down!

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:08.000
I stopped them...

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:12.520
I thank you for fighting 
alongside our soldiers.

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:17.140
H-Hmph! No thanks are needed.

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:23.720
Reporting!

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.470
We've gained control of 
the cathedral's exterior

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:28.570
and moved the battle inside.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:33.870
I suppose this means 
the plan was a success.

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:36.940
It would seem your sword is truly powerful.

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:40.380
However... I do smell something.

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:44.320
Is there something suspicious 
in Twilight's movements?

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:46.480
No...

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:50.570
It's a detective's intuition.

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:02.230
Will Saint and Drac be all right?

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.520
They said to leave things to them.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:05.730
We don't need to worry.

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:09.010
There's no one here.

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:12.980
You don't think Finis was just 
luring us in here, do you?

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:16.120
If he was, there's no going back.

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:20.300
That's right. The only 
way to go is forward!

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:24.230
Everything we've been chasing 
after is up ahead, right?

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:28.330
Let's just squash Twilight and 
get this whole thing resolved!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.990
Squash them?

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:33.150
You make it sound so simple.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:36.440
Well, what we need to do <i>is</i> simple.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:40.260
To stop Code: Realize and 
get rid of your poison.

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:45.520
Yeah. Every part of this is 
an important goal for us.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:49.730
Saving this world and 
granting your wish, too.

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:54.690
We crush Isaac's ambitions, and 
peace will reign in the world.

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:59.330
And with her poison gone, 
Cardia can finally be with me!

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:03.030
It's a super happy ending!

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:05.340
Yeah, if you drop that last part.

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:08.160
You can't just drop that! Jeez!

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:17.810
Let's make your wish come true, Cardia.

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:20.180
Okay. Thank you.

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:32.180
Hey, come on, Van. You say something, too.

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:38.010
I don't object to getting 
information out of Finis,

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.570
but we can't afford to take our time.

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:44.110
I will complete my own objective.

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:46.590
At any cost.

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:50.950
We're going in.

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:32.530
This is much more enjoyable 
than I expected.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:35.170
As I'd expect of a Twilight officer...

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:37.220
is what I should say, I suppose.

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:41.790
However, I have no time left 
for this little game.

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:47.060
It seems the same goes for me.

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:50.310
Forward! Forward!

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.290
What is that thing?

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:07.090
A gigantic celestial globe?

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:10.850
Is this my father's secret?

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:14.540
The thing called Code: Realize?

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:17.710
Not quite.

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:21.020
I've been waiting for you, Sister.

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:24.960
Welcome to the place where all will begin.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.660
Finis...

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:29.780
I had really hoped you would come alone,

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:32.250
but it seems you've brought 
some interferences.

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:34.970
A lady needs an escort, right?

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:41.190
Even after all this, you can 
still speak so impudently?

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:42.960
You have my praise.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:48.800
It appears the major powers have already 
caught wind of the civil war above us.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:53.240
If they invade, 
the British Empire is done for.

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.740
Is that what you're after?

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:59.510
Well, too bad for you. We've got
 a iron-willed queen on our side.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.850
You won't get your way that easily.

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:15.140
We don't have time.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:17.750
Tell us every last detail you know!

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:23.770
Everything I know? Such as...

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:26.770
how your family died?

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:31.970
Oh, or shall I show you the 
reports from when it happened?

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:36.390
I'm sure everything you want to 
know is written there in detail.

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:41.130
So, did you come all the way 
here to learn about that?

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:42.620
Shut up!

00:13:43.140 --> 00:13:46.990
You didn't, did you? Just be honest!

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:50.220
Come out and say you want to kill me!

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:59.090
I told you to shut up! 
If you don't, I will—

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:10.440
Cardia!

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.610
I-I'm okay.

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.830
Don't touch my sister!

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:29.590
Saint...

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:34.060
Impossible...

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:38.280
I had no other choice.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:53.050
Finis...

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:56.750
I never thought it would end like this.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:00.350
That's it? It's over?

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:05.020
<i>This</i> is how you died in the end?

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:08.320
Like this?

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:12.280
What the hell have I been...

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:16.130
Would you like me to let 
you kill me, Helsing?

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:19.880
What the hell's going on?!

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:23.100
If my sister is a monster,

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:27.550
doesn't it follow that her little brother
 would be a monster, too?

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:33.780
I'll show you. This is the truth of what I...

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:36.280
what Finis is.

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.790
Are you surprised?

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:46.290
But, you see, these are all just puppets.

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:48.910
The real me is right here.

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:53.530
That device... is Finis?

00:15:53.530 --> 00:16:00.300
That's right. And at the same time, 
it is our father, Isaac Beckford.

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:04.630
Our human father died,

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:07.640
and was reborn as this mechanical vessel.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:10.360
He's currently asleep, though.

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:13.690
Father... It can't be...

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:17.970
What reason is there to grieve?

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:22.830
The unrivaled genius scientist 
gained an immortal body.

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:28.340
Of course, it's no surprise that ordinary 
folk like you wouldn't understand.

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:29.820
He's insane...

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:36.350
My sister and myself...

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:39.170
The keys to the plan have been gathered.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:44.580
My sister's heart, the perpetual 
motion Horologium...

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:47.450
When it fuses with me,

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:50.140
a god will be born into this world!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:55.300
A mechanical god surpassing 
all human knowledge!

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:57.150
A god?

00:16:57.610 --> 00:17:01.670
You'd go to such lengths just for a war?!

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:04.760
You don't understand.

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:08.330
Just think about all of human history.

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:12.810
In times of war, mankind 
has invented many things

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:15.130
and made many scientific advancements.

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:20.920
War is the one thing that 
keeps humanity evolving.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.920
In a war that never ends,

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:26.440
humanity will evolve infinitely!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:30.910
That is the true purpose of Code: Realize!

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:34.450
Our father is going to 
reconstruct this world anew!

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:43.620
You'll be coming with me, Sister.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:47.960
Let us carry out our father's dearest wish.

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:51.460
We'll stop that plan of 
yours right here and now!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:53.710
We won't let you take her!

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:55.970
Now, let's go.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:18:01.430
Let us become a part of the god 
our father will be reborn into.

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:06.720
He's...

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:08.610
What are you doing?

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:13.220
Shouldn't you be protecting my sister?

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:15.250
How cold of you!

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:22.590
My goal has always been you!

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:27.750
If you kill me, you won't be able 
to get rid of my sister's poison.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.150
Van!

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:51.360
What's going on?!

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:56.410
Gravity has reversed?

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.270
You're kidding!

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:01.030
Evacuate! Evacuate!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:10.850
This is...

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:12.800
You must be joking.

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:17.290
Wonderful! Just wonderful!

00:19:17.290 --> 00:19:21.040
This is my greatest masterpiece!

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:24.400
The giant, unsinkable air battleship,

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:27.060
the Nautilus!

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:29.340
Nemo? And Nautilus...

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:31.430
It was mentioned in Isaac's notes!

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:38.190
Cardia!

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:39.510
Let me go!

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:43.070
All will begin very soon.

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:48.840
The moment when we'll be rewarded 
for everything is at hand.

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:50.200
Cardia!

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:55.080
Cardia!

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.080
Grab on!

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:58.180
Lupin!

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:13.850
That won't do.

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:15.360
Lupin!

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.750
My sister belongs to me.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:21.500
I won't let anyone have her.

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:24.210
We're going to become one.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:29.500
Now, at last, Father will love me.

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:34.560
Cardia...

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:39.640
Trust me, Cardia!

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:44.880
I swear... I swear I'll steal you back!

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:47.400
So trust me and wait!

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:51.110
Okay. I'll trust you.

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:57.400
So no matter what... 
No matter what, we'll...

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:19.910
<i>A fog of death cloaks the earth's surface.</i>

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:23.670
<i>The world groans and screams.</i>

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:30.430
<i>The dream I thought was right before me,</i>

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:31.640
<i>my wish,</i>

00:21:32.260 --> 00:21:34.360
<i>is gone from my sight now.</i>

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:38.640
<i>The flames of war burn without end,</i>

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:41.290
<i>just as the god wishes,</i>

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.620
<i>until this world is burned to ashes.</i>
